{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0103_1000_034ayu", "source_sha256": "37e3c268999230140dde2832ed634048c2297a2e65ad562d13f911ad32de9ba8", "ja": "なんか、違うんだよなー……。\nえーっと……ここをこうして……。うーん……。", "zh": "总觉得不对呢……\n呃……这里要这样……唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0103_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5f04f3cce105e68d76620baca2d76d3f73ce42621aa960c76f73800b275ed710", "ja": "あれ、歩？　ひとりで考え込んで、どうかしたのか？\nよかったら、相談に……。", "zh": "咦？步，你怎么一个人在沉思？\n不嫌弃的话，可以找我商量……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0103_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "13facf48829463f75988d349d507a72d18a22489478ef63d561b87b695c7d14d", "ja": "あああ～っ！　やっぱりダメだ～っ！！", "zh": "啊啊啊～！果然不行～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0103_1003_p", "source_sha256": "adf4ba97808c3b977b64d47e903e49d852e9a961d62c07dcb9bdb02e4e4e9705", "ja": "うわあっ！？\n歩、どうしたんだ！　何かあったのか！？", "zh": "哇啊！？\n步，怎么了！发生什么事了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0103_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e9f38ff379e292c7fc0481e3c27e4900b847e997735894288434f5d8a0a65723", "ja": "えっ？　あっ、{$P$}！\nえ、え～と……ごめん、急に大声出して。", "zh": "咦？啊，{$P$}！\n那、那～个……对不起，突然大喊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0103_1005_p", "source_sha256": "527d2925cf0f0a8657b8f089751b94d0f8307406d80f0507cdefda1345819bd4", "ja": "いや、それは別にいいんだけど……\n何かあったわけじゃないのか？", "zh": "没事，突然大喊是没关系……\n但应该是发生了什么事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0103_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "10641f2a1ec969eb208e461cd09b613efe4e41bb08d4d5d73f87d5f47de7c2b7", "ja": "い、いや～……。ちょっと、絵を\n練習してみようかな～なんて……。あははっ……。", "zh": "没、没有啦……我只是在想要不要练习一下画图……\n啊哈哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0103_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "258166fae3ac499b8d1d62aeff2b30d617b253b6dad812739a7180bec276d8b1", "ja": "ほら、ロコって、自分のイメージを絵で伝えることが\nできるだろ？　それってすごいって思ったんだ！", "zh": "你也知道，ROCO不是会用画图来传达自己的想法吗？\n我觉得那样很厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0103_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a5dd8980e960ae48e0fb3c1ddf20c07eb03e78d0d504b8913641af827dcce0b1", "ja": "ああ。レトロポップ公演も、ロコの絵で\nみんなの方向性が一気にまとまったな。", "zh": "是啊，复古风公演也是靠ROCO的画，\n让大家一下子决定好方向。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0103_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "658a08d744fb91eba68378649d22ad04307e7814915ca66821526e2edeab005d", "ja": "だろ？　アタシも、そんなふうにできたらって\n練習してみたんだけど、全然うまくいかなくて。", "zh": "对吧？我也好希望自己能做得到，\n就试着练习了一下，结果完全画不好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0103_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f7f0057eca445fe71b1e95504bdddefa61fc7d08a01838508930bf8e1b5eaf04", "ja": "やっぱ、アタシには才能がないのかな……。", "zh": "我果然没有天分吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0103_1011", "source_sha256": "f71674f056fad2ebb35185b65762596bf128d3cb576960efd1d39ea01fcea0b7", "ja": "そんなことはない", "zh": "没这回事", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0103_2000_p", "source_sha256": "ea67b3ab5ed1b2e7f240408da543701a3dced9211934fd910aba210632a871b3", "ja": "そんなことはないぞ！　歩だって、ダンスでみんなに\n自分のイメージを伝えることができるけど……。", "zh": "没有这回事！\n像你可以用舞蹈向大家表达自己的想法，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0103_2001_p", "source_sha256": "ba9c2541fc76015a94ae3d50bbeb4c31db0c867e0020fda3dc32b48995a19f3a", "ja": "最初から、そんなスゴイことができたわけじゃ\nないだろ？　練習を積み重ねた成果じゃないか。", "zh": "你也不是一开始就有这么强大的能力吧？\n这也是不断练习后得到的成果啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0103_2002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "50386f8d855e2414d9f30727b3268a8acca876a0b0b74537bbe7205b3fb71fa3", "ja": "そっか……そうだよな、簡単にはいかないか。\nサンキュー、{$P$}！", "zh": "这样啊……说得也是，总不可能一步登天。\n谢啦，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0103_2003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "03a14178ebe379630b55a1782a822d88057657e2acefcc06ff5118757f976868", "ja": "アタシも、もうちょっとがんばってみようかな。\nと、その前に、ちょっと気分転換にダンスしてくるよ。", "zh": "我也再继续努力一下看看吧。\n不过在这之前，我先去跳舞转换一下心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0103_2004_p", "source_sha256": "a79c9ae777fc4426d8534ac4db330f4183d4b54985d207a5697ea30bdb169c8a", "ja": "ああ。レッスンルームは誰も使ってないはずだから、\n思う存分、体を動かしてくるといいよ。", "zh": "嗯，练习室应该没有人在用，\n你就尽情地去活动身体吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0103_2005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f5f7094adae7ed15408517cdb268cae77497c3373b90f23359510e3f916fa79d", "ja": "ありがと！\nんじゃ、ちょっと行ってくるね！", "zh": "谢谢！\n那我就去跳个舞啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0103_2006_p", "source_sha256": "1733d659e5e2006eba8729fef8007bb764b71e49ce5edce3fce7b91c60a2d9a3", "ja": "（他のアイドルに影響されて、新しい事に挑戦する。\nみんなと頑張れる環境があるから、できる事だな！）", "zh": "（受其他偶像影响而挑战新的事物。\n因为是能跟大家一起努力的环境，才能发挥这种效果！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0103_2007_p", "source_sha256": "66e83816e3606ff4d854a217bc71237f1f037fe3c5343b61e2ef7d39cfd5846a", "ja": "（……それより、歩はどんな絵を描いていたんだろう？\nえーっと……）", "zh": "（……话说回来，步画出了怎样的图呢？\n我看看……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0103_2008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "83cb440e73f0919eb8577875a3998d4dc3e5ec157c31981392caedb4812bb8d5", "ja": "うわあああ～っ！？\n絵、出しっぱなしだった～っ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊～！？\n我忘了把画收起来～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0103_2009_p", "source_sha256": "d3714071b23c222d2086c33f2ee21be5848e84540f745bf8047d72ddb351db76", "ja": "うわあっ！？\nあ、歩、今度はどうしたんだ？", "zh": "哇啊！？\n我、我说步，这次又怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0103_2010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0a3b9bdea789641cf9ee82e71dfe962b861e532fcbb16570face66311cdf17ca", "ja": "{$P$}、その絵は見ちゃダメっ！\nそれは失敗作だから、もっとうまくなってからっ！", "zh": "{$P$}，你不可以看那张图！\n那是失败作，等我画得更好了再给你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0103_2011_p", "source_sha256": "3577b448cdca16cf8436cb0c75152d8a3d41598896ff5a1725cf98b6484a929d", "ja": "わ、わかった。自信作ができたら見せてくれ！\n楽しみに待ってるから！", "zh": "我、我知道了，等你画出自信之作再给我看吧！\n我会拭目以待的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
